<meta name="description" content="Section 503A of the FD&amp;C Act applies to human drug compounding by a licensed pharmacist within a state-licensed pharmacy or federal facility, or by a licensed physician, that is not a registered outsourcing facility. Section 503B applies to human drug compounding within an outsourcing facility." />
